Her Smell is a drama, music film directed by Alex Ross Perry.

2
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:14,000
A self-destructive punk rocker struggles with sobriety while trying to
recapture the creative inspiration that led her band to success.

3
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:18,000
Becky Something, played by Elisabeth Moss.

4
00:36:16,000 --> 00:36:22,000
Crassy Cassie, played by Cara Delevingne.

5
00:45:20,000 --> 00:45:26,000
'Dirtbag' Danny, played by Dan Stevens.

6
00:54:24,000 --> 00:54:30,000
Marielle Hell, played by Agyness Deyn.

7
